              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musa yaagambira Hobabu, mwene Reueli Omunyamidiani ishezaara wa Musa, ati: Nitwimutsya orugyendo kuza omu nsi ei MUKAMA yaagambire kutuha. Ija tugyendane; nitwija kukukorera gye; ahakuba MUKAMA akaraganisa kukorera Abaisraeli ebirungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
